    "sections": {
        "description": "Storecraft Pet Shop is a modern WordPress theme built for pet stores, pet supply shops, and animal care brands. Powered by WooCommerce, it helps you showcase food, toys, beds, grooming products, and accessories for dogs, cats, birds, and other pets in a clean, conversion-focused layout. The customizable homepage includes a hero slider, product category grid, featured products with category tabs, blog section, features bar, and newsletter signup. Fully responsive and optimized for speed, the theme looks great on desktop, tablet, and mobile. Built to WordPress coding standards with Gutenberg support, it works seamlessly with WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, WPForms, and Elementor. Customize colors, header, footer, and homepage sections through the WordPress Customizer — no coding required. Ideal for launching an online pet shop, pet supply store, or animal care business."
    },
